{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 2763 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "ede31dd34cf93577e9b93810d6f8c65bb3fa1aef12165ce04e8faf74e5ae0fec" :edb/db-before-t 2762 :edb/db-after-t 2763 :edb/tx-data [[13194139536075 50 #inst "2026-10-09T14:25:24.043Z" 13194139536075 true] [17592186198306 1020 #edb/ref 17592186382502 13194139536075 true] [17592186198306 1020 #edb/ref 17592186382516 13194139536075 true] [17592186198306 1020 #edb/ref 17592186382523 13194139536075 true] [17592186198319 1020 #edb/ref 17592186382509 13194139536075 true] [17592186198529 1017 #edb/ref 17592186194075 13194139536075 false] [17592186198529 1017 #edb/ref 17592186382496 13194139536075 true] [17592186198529 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536075 true] [17592186198529 1100 "For a surface $S$ given by $z = g(x, y)$ for $(x, y) ∈ D$, the flux of the vector field $F(x, y, z) = ⟨P, Q, R⟩$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$∬_(S)F \\cdot dS = ∬_(D)(A\\frac{A}{∂x} - Q\\frac{∂g}{A} + R)dA$.\nFrom left to right, what are the missing parts of the formula?" 13194139536075 false] [17592186198529 1100 "For a surface $S$ given by $z=g(x,y)$ for $(x,y)\\in D,$ the flux of the vector field $F(x,y,z)=⟨P,\\,Q,\\,R⟩$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{D}(\\frac{}{∂x}-Q\\frac{∂g}{}+R)\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nFrom left to right, what are the missing parts of the formula?" 13194139536075 true] [17592186198529 1145 "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the flux of a vector field $F$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{S}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nSince our surface $S$ is of the form $z=g(x,y),$ it can be parameterized as\n\n$$\nr(x,y)=⟨x,\\,y,\\,g(x,y)⟩.\n$$\n\nWe now compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{x}^{′} & =⟨1,\\,0,\\,\\frac{∂g}{∂x}⟩ \\\\ {r}_{y}^{′} & =⟨0,\\,1,\\,\\frac{∂g}{∂y}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{x}^{′}\\times {r}_{y}^{′} & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 1 & 0 & \\frac{∂g}{∂x} \\\\ 0 & 1 & \\frac{∂g}{∂y}\\end{aligned}|=⟨-\\frac{∂g}{∂x},\\,-\\frac{∂g}{∂y},\\,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}F(r(x,y))\\cdot ({r}_{x}^{′}\\times {r}_{y}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}⟨P,\\,Q,\\,R⟩\\cdot ⟨-\\frac{∂g}{∂x},\\,-\\frac{∂g}{∂y},\\,1⟩\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(-P\\frac{∂g}{∂x}-Q\\frac{∂g}{∂y}+R)\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382496 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382497 13194139536075 true] [17592186382496 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382498 13194139536075 true] [17592186382496 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382499 13194139536075 true] [17592186382496 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382500 13194139536075 true] [17592186382496 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382501 13194139536075 true] [17592186382496 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536075 true] [17592186382496 1041 "selection" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382496 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382498 13194139536075 true] [17592186382496 1110 #uuid "324a0f9b-cadb-5547-a07a-b1885fec81e0" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382497 1034 "$P,\\,$ $∂g,\\,$ $∂y$" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382497 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536075 true] [17592186382497 1111 #uuid "0cf7b227-c9b8-5691-bde2-c7243ba05185" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382498 1034 "$-P,\\,$ $∂g,\\,$ $∂y$" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382498 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536075 true] [17592186382498 1111 #uuid "bde35da4-fca8-5ae2-8cb7-415627421334" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382499 1034 "$-P,\\,$ $∂g,\\,$ $∂x$" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382499 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536075 true] [17592186382499 1111 #uuid "23ac8c5e-c943-55ac-a0a2-81fa6479bd08" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382500 1034 "$P,\\,$ $∂g,\\,$ $∂x$" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382500 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536075 true] [17592186382500 1111 #uuid "8202e075-1e06-510b-a38b-ce574702ee6d" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382501 1034 "$-P,\\,$ $∂P,\\,$ $∂x$" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382501 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139536075 true] [17592186382501 1111 #uuid "50f6a300-1e35-52db-8554-2707309c5433" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382502 1017 #edb/ref 17592186382503 13194139536075 true] [17592186382502 1089 "q-161435" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382502 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536075 true] [17592186382502 1100 "Evaluate the surface integral\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}⟨xy,\\,x+y,\\,{e}^{z}⟩\\cdot \\text{d}S\n$$\n\nwhere the surface $S$ is defined by $z=x+y$ for $0\\le x\\le 1$ and $0\\le y\\le x.$" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382502 1113 #uuid "afd6524e-9981-5d04-b2d9-53c6f686b4d2" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382502 1145 "For a surface $S$ given by $z=g(x,y)$ for $(x,y)\\in D,$ the flux of a vector field $F(x,y,z)=⟨P,\\,Q,\\,R⟩$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{D}(-P\\frac{∂g}{∂x}-Q\\frac{∂g}{∂y}+R)\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the partial derivatives of the graph $z=g(x,y):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂g}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(x+y)=1 \\\\ \\frac{∂g}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(x+y)=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the equation $z=g(x,y)$ into $F(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(x,y,g(x,y)) & =⟨xy,\\,x+y,\\,{e}^{z}⟩{|}_{z=x+y} \\\\  & =⟨xy,\\,x+y,\\,{e}^{x+y}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{{xy}_{⏟}}_{P},\\,{{x+y}_{⏟}}_{Q},\\,{{{e}^{x+y}}_{⏟}}_{R}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can evaluate our surface integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}⟨xy,\\,x+y,\\,{e}^{z}⟩\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}(-P\\frac{∂g}{∂x}-Q\\frac{∂g}{∂y}+R)\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(-(xy)\\cdot 1-(x+y)\\cdot 1+{e}^{x+y})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(-xy-x-y+{e}^{x+y})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{0}^{x}(-xy-x-y+{e}^{x+y})\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}{[-\\frac{x{y}^{2}}{2}-xy-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2}+{e}^{x+y}]}_{y=0}^{y=x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{2}-{x}^{2}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}+{e}^{2x}-{e}^{x})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}(-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{2}-\\frac{3{x}^{2}}{2}+{e}^{2x}-{e}^{x})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[-\\frac{{x}^{4}}{8}-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{2}+\\frac{{e}^{2x}}{2}-{e}^{x}]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =(-\\frac{1}{8}-\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{{e}^{2}}{2}-e)-(0+\\frac{1}{2}-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{4{e}^{2}-8e-1}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382503 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382504 13194139536075 true] [17592186382503 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382505 13194139536075 true] [17592186382503 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382506 13194139536075 true] [17592186382503 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382507 13194139536075 true] [17592186382503 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382508 13194139536075 true] [17592186382503 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536075 true] [17592186382503 1041 "selection" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382503 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382506 13194139536075 true] [17592186382503 1110 #uuid "8ccd42e7-12bb-5f6a-9513-22af848b8f70" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382504 1034 "\\frac{8e-1}{8}" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382504 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536075 true] [17592186382504 1111 #uuid "f18d0a5c-cea3-5a67-afbe-3ccf23901d60" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382505 1034 "\\frac{4{e}^{2}-8e}{8}" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382505 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536075 true] [17592186382505 1111 #uuid "534ac176-0233-5f15-b86f-13383c3f5416" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382506 1034 "\\frac{4{e}^{2}-8e-1}{8}" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382506 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536075 true] [17592186382506 1111 #uuid "40be4934-a3ab-518e-b0bb-649486ed7e3c" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382507 1034 "\\frac{4{e}^{2}+1}{8}" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382507 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536075 true] [17592186382507 1111 #uuid "3eba5cb2-7d57-5fa6-8347-2e9f7e7d9b7c" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382508 1034 "\\frac{4{e}^{2}-1}{8}" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382508 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536075 true] [17592186382508 1111 #uuid "e6c75a04-f929-501d-b9ce-0d993a68daef" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382509 1017 #edb/ref 17592186382510 13194139536075 true] [17592186382509 1089 "q-161465" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382509 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139536075 true] [17592186382509 1100 "For a surface $S$ given by $x=k(y,z)$ for $(y,z)\\in D,$ the flux of the vector field $F(x,y,z)=⟨P,\\,Q,\\,R⟩$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{D}(P-\\,-R\\,)\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nFrom left to right, what are the missing parts of the formula?" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382509 1113 #uuid "ce7abf15-5470-59cf-959c-492a8c66495f" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382509 1145 "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the flux of a vector field $F$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{S}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}F(r(u,v))\\cdot ({r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nSince our surface $S$ is of the form $x=k(y,z),$ it can be parameterized as\n\n$$\nr(y,z)=⟨k(y,z),\\,y,\\,z⟩.\n$$\n\nWe now compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{y}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂k}{∂y},\\,1,\\,0⟩ \\\\ {r}_{z}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂k}{∂z},\\,0,\\,1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{y}^{′}\\times {r}_{z}^{′} & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ \\frac{∂k}{∂y} & 1 & 0 \\\\ \\frac{∂k}{∂z} & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}|=⟨1,\\,-\\frac{∂k}{∂y},\\,-\\frac{∂k}{∂z}⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}F(r(x,y))\\cdot ({r}_{y}^{′}\\times {r}_{z}^{′})\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}⟨P,\\,Q,\\,R⟩\\cdot ⟨1,\\,-\\frac{∂k}{∂y},\\,-\\frac{∂k}{∂z}⟩\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(P-Q\\,\\frac{∂k}{∂y}-R\\,\\frac{∂k}{∂z})\\,\\text{d}A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382510 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382511 13194139536075 true] [17592186382510 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382512 13194139536075 true] [17592186382510 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382513 13194139536075 true] [17592186382510 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382514 13194139536075 true] [17592186382510 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382515 13194139536075 true] [17592186382510 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536075 true] [17592186382510 1041 "selection" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382510 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382513 13194139536075 true] [17592186382510 1110 #uuid "0bb1c8f2-e35a-5ce0-a8b8-63701b0f3baa" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382511 1034 "Q,\\text{ }\\frac{∂k}{∂y},\\text{ }\\frac{∂k}{∂x}" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382511 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536075 true] [17592186382511 1111 #uuid "d331386a-7420-5e9b-8b84-e79285c94750" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382512 1034 "-Q,\\text{ }\\frac{∂k}{∂x},\\text{ }\\frac{∂k}{∂z}" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382512 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536075 true] [17592186382512 1111 #uuid "d86f08ee-46a5-5d5c-a4f6-6ab578a67d65" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382513 1034 "Q,\\text{ }\\frac{∂k}{∂y},\\text{ }\\frac{∂k}{∂z}" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382513 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536075 true] [17592186382513 1111 #uuid "6d5c1b9e-bb8a-508e-bccf-cf999c09ffd7" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382514 1034 "-Q,\\text{ }\\frac{∂k}{∂y},\\text{ }\\frac{∂k}{∂z}" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382514 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536075 true] [17592186382514 1111 #uuid "83d932bf-ac71-5275-9b57-4a0085556665" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382515 1034 "-Q,\\text{ }\\frac{∂k}{∂z},\\text{ }\\frac{∂k}{∂y}" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382515 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536075 true] [17592186382515 1111 #uuid "b2ab5af8-f54d-54ad-9e2e-73bc5c880dc1" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382516 1017 #edb/ref 17592186382517 13194139536075 true] [17592186382516 1089 "q-161541" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382516 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139536075 true] [17592186382516 1100 "Calculate the flux of the vector field\n\n$$\nF(x,y,z)=⟨\\sqrt{\\frac{x}{y}},\\,\\sqrt{\\frac{x}{y}},\\,{z}^{2}+1⟩,\n$$\n\nwhere the surface $S$ is defined by $z=2\\sqrt{xy}$ for $3\\le x\\le 4$ and $1\\le y\\le 2.$" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382516 1113 #uuid "c65e1ef4-e971-501b-8625-feef09c152dd" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382516 1145 "For a surface $S$ given by $z=g(x,y)$ for $(x,y)\\in D,$ the flux of a vector field $F(x,y,z)=⟨P,\\,Q,\\,R⟩$ over $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}F\\cdot \\text{d}S={∬}_{D}(-P\\frac{∂g}{∂x}-Q\\frac{∂g}{∂y}+R)\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the partial derivatives of the graph $z=g(x,y):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂g}{∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(2\\sqrt{xy})=\\sqrt{\\frac{y}{x}} \\\\ \\frac{∂g}{∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2\\sqrt{xy})=\\sqrt{\\frac{x}{y}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIn this case, the flux of $F$ through $S$ is given by \n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}⟨\\sqrt{\\frac{x}{y}},\\,\\sqrt{\\frac{x}{y}},\\,{z}^{2}+1⟩\\cdot \\text{d}S\n$$\n\nNext, we substitute the equation $z=g(x,y)$ into $F(x,y,z):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(x,y,g(x,y)) & =⟨\\sqrt{\\frac{x}{y}},\\,\\sqrt{\\frac{x}{y}},\\,{z}^{2}+1⟩{|}_{z=2\\sqrt{xy}} \\\\  & =⟨{{\\sqrt{\\frac{x}{y}}}_{⏟}}_{P},\\,{{\\sqrt{\\frac{x}{y}}}_{⏟}}_{Q},\\,{{4xy+1}_{⏟}}_{R}⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can evaluate our surface integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}⟨\\sqrt{\\frac{x}{y}},\\,\\sqrt{\\frac{x}{y}},\\,{z}^{2}+1⟩\\cdot \\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}(-P\\frac{∂g}{∂x}-Q\\frac{∂g}{∂y}+R)\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(-\\sqrt{\\frac{x}{y}}\\cdot \\sqrt{\\frac{y}{x}}-\\sqrt{\\frac{x}{y}}\\cdot \\sqrt{\\frac{x}{y}}+4xy+1)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(-1-\\frac{x}{y}+4xy+1)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}(-\\frac{x}{y}+4xy)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{3}^{4}{\\int }_{1}^{2}(-\\frac{x}{y}+4xy)\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{3}^{4}{[-x\\operatorname{ln}⁡y+2x{y}^{2}]}_{y=1}^{y=2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{3}^{4}(-x\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+8x+0-2x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{3}^{4}(6-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =(6-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2){[\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}]}_{3}^{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{7(6-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382517 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382518 13194139536075 true] [17592186382517 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382519 13194139536075 true] [17592186382517 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382520 13194139536075 true] [17592186382517 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382521 13194139536075 true] [17592186382517 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382522 13194139536075 true] [17592186382517 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536075 true] [17592186382517 1041 "selection" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382517 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382520 13194139536075 true] [17592186382517 1110 #uuid "bd083817-246a-5e7a-9d91-8c1ac722854a" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382518 1034 "\\frac{7(2-\\operatorname{ln}⁡4)}{2}" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382518 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536075 true] [17592186382518 1111 #uuid "eba9ddb8-6f53-572a-be52-1182e40d9d9f" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382519 1034 "\\frac{7(3-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)}{2}" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382519 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536075 true] [17592186382519 1111 #uuid "163c0a86-5178-5d24-aee3-f6409ef89e3a" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382520 1034 "\\frac{7(6-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)}{2}" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382520 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536075 true] [17592186382520 1111 #uuid "d96f830f-6566-5d91-ac8d-6451d5d04872" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382521 1034 "\\frac{4(3-\\operatorname{ln}⁡2)}{2}" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382521 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536075 true] [17592186382521 1111 #uuid "5a64bc40-8f8a-5091-97d0-2358e8f21db6" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382522 1034 "\\frac{7(3-\\operatorname{ln}⁡4)}{2}" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382522 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536075 true] [17592186382522 1111 #uuid "96d89a9f-d7d6-5e53-8707-79240df6d741" 13194139536075 true] [17592186382523 1017 #edb/ref 17592186382524 13194139536075 true